// Package sha1 hashes text with SHA-1 (RFC 3174; docs/spec/stdlib.md,
// keyed digests; std-spike D3), for formats that name it: Git object ids,
// WebSocket handshakes, TOTP's default HMAC. SHA-1 has known collisions:
// it is no signature or integrity check, and new formats take sha256. It
// is Go's crypto/sha1 over Ergo's strings, which hold bytes.

// Sum is the SHA-1 digest of the bytes of s: 20 raw bytes, as Go's Sum.
extern go ergo.local/prototype/runtime/v1/digest.Sha1Sum func Sum(s string) string

// SumIs20Bytes: every digest is 20 bytes.
law SumIs20Bytes(s string) { len(Sum(s)) == 20 }
